{"availability":"available","full":"twenion/hotel-site-demo","name":"hotel-site-demo","description":"Fictional Şəki guesthouse website demo with 365 published nightly prices and a booking flow.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-29T07:47:16Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:56:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://twenion.github.io/hotel-site-demo/","topics":["azerbaijan","demo","hospitality","portfolio","static-site","vanilla-javascript"],"demo":"https://twenion.github.io/hotel-site-demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:46.174Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:46.174Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:46.174Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:23:46.174Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A static site for a boutique guesthouse in Şəki, Azerbaijan, built as a portfolio piece and a sales demo. The guesthouse is fictional — no real business's name, branding, rooms, prices or photography are used, the form takes nothing and sends nothing, and the site says so in its own footer.","8 rooms · 24 pages · 365 published nightly prices · no framework · no build step at runtime · no CDN · no cookies","I audit small-business websites in Azerbaijan. On hotel sites one fault outranks all the others, and it is not technical: the price is not on the page. You get \"qiymət üçün əlaqə saxlayın\". Almost nobody writes. They go to Booking.com and book the same room there — and the hotel pays 15–18% commission on a guest who had already found their own website."],"features":["8 rooms, each its own static URL with HotelRoom structured data: occupancy,","A reservation form with no back end. It computes nights, season and total in the","A restaurant menu with Restaurant + Menu schema, and a Şəki guide of four","A share card per room — 1200×630 PNG showing the room, its size, its steps and","Light and dark, both measured against WCAG AA